    "faqs_K3cnXc": {
      "type": "faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_azN9mK": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will my order take to arrive?",
            "description": "<p>All orders will ship within 3 days of order receipt. Our standard shipping policy takes anywhere from 4-9 days, depending on location, and our expedited service takes anywhere from 3-5 days. </p><p>For international shipments, you can expect the following lead times:</p><p>Canada: 1 - 4 days</p><p>EU: 1 - 3 days</p><p>United Kingdom: 1 - 4 days</p><p>Asia: 1 - 4 days</p><p>Africa: 1- 2 days</p><p>Australia: 1 - 4 days</p><p>New Zealand: 1 - 3 days</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_fq7mKz": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you ship and do you ship internationally?",
            "description": "<p>We currently ship within the USA. </p><p>As of Oct. 16, we will begin fulfilling international orders to the following geographies: Canada, EU, UK, Asia, Australia. We cannot support international shipments to PO boxes.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_KCgCcH": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much does shipping cost?",
            "description": "<p>Standard shipping is complementary on orders of $60 and over. If your order is below $60 then standard shipping is $7.95 and our expedited shipping is between $10-20 based on the product volume ordered.</p><p>For international shipments, orders over $80 will have complimentary shipping. If your order is below $80 our shipping is $15.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_4NBCXH": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "description": "<p>If you wish to initiate a return for your order please reach out to <a href=\"mailto:hi@freaksofnature.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">hi@freaksofnature.com</span></a> or +1 (888) 272-9391 within 30 days of receiving your order. Items must be unused in their original carton packaging and, at this time, we do not provide the shipping label or cost of postage. </p><p>If you receive a damaged or missing item, we apologize! Please take a picture of the package within 48 hours and reach out to <a href=\"mailto:hi@freaksofnature.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">hi@freaksofnature.com</span></a> with your order number and the details. We will work to resolve the issue immediately. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_8aRXt6": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does an exchange or return take to process?",
            "description": "<p>In some instances, it may take our customer service 1-2 to review your return request. Once a return is dropped off and scanned by the shipping carrier, the return is processed - credit card refunds usually take 3-10 business days to appear on your statement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_Q9MiMF": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I buy Freaks of Nature in person?",
            "description": "<p>We currently ship within the USA and at this time we are entirely direct-to-consumer. Please sign up to our newsletter for updates!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
