            "description": "<p>We offer a monthly subscription for our products so that you never run out of your skincare. Select delivery every 1, 2 or 3 months for up to 15% off the product + free shipping. To subscribe, head to the product page and select the `Subscribe` option and select your preferred delivery cadence.</p>"
